  "description": "To remove a holly bush tree in the front garden down to the stump, a few inches from ground level. Would estimate the tree is 7 metres tall.Removal is required to gain more light into the house and to renew the front garden completely.In order to adhere to the Hackney Local Plan 2033 policy LP51 B, a replacement tree will planted within the front garden.&nbsp; The new tree will be at least light standard size (6-8 cm girth), a native species or one known to provide benefits to local wildlife, climate resilient, and a species which is not considered invasive in Hackney.&nbsp; The new tree will be planted within 12 months of the removal of the existing one.",
